return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;','language'=>'fy','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.2.3','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:19+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:19+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'Ferstjoerd as jo op Babilim ynskeakelje drukke, en nochris as de side opnij registrearre wurde moat: de URL fan jo side, de ferzjes fan WordPress, PHP en Babilim, de taal fan jo side en de brûkte talen dêrop, en in publike kaai dy\'t foar dizze side generearre is.','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'Ferstjoerd by elke kontrôle: de list mei ynstallearre plugins en tema\'s mei de status fan elke Babilim-oersetting dy\'t foar harren ynstallearre is, de brûkte talen en koarte diagnostyske koades.','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'Elk fersyk befettet de URL fan jo side, en it tagongstoken fan de side wurdt meistjoerd wannear\'t de tsjinst it nedich hat.','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Wat Babilim nei de tsjinst stjoert','Your site\'s URL'=>'De URL fan jo side','WordPress version'=>'WordPress-ferzje','PHP version'=>'PHP-ferzje','Babilim version'=>'Babilim-ferzje','Your site\'s language'=>'De taal fan jo side','Languages in use on your site'=>'Brûkte talen op jo side','A public key for this site'=>'In publike kaai foar dizze side','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'In publike kaai dy\'t foar dizze side generearre is en brûkt wurdt om te bewizen dat fersiken echt fan dizze side komme. Allinnich de publike helte wurdt ea ferstjoerd; de priveehelte bliuwt op jo side.','Installed plugins and themes'=>'Ynstallearre plugins en tema\'s','Source files (only if you confirm an upload)'=>'Boarnebestannen (allinnich as jo in oplaad befêstigje)','Diagnostic codes'=>'Diagnostyske koades','Up to 20 short diagnostic codes (for example, a translation file that failed its check), each with the plugin or theme, the language and the time it happened. They never contain any text from your site or any translated text.'=>'Maksimaal 20 koarte diagnostyske koades (bygelyks in oersettingsbestân dat syn kontrôle net trochstien is), elk mei de plugin of it tema, de taal en it tiidstip dat it barde. Se befetsje nea tekst fan jo side of oersette tekst.','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'%1$d side op dit netwurk is ynsteld om syn Babilim-identiteit te wiskjen as de plugin fuorthelle wurdt. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dy side keppele is, kin dan net automatysk werom set wurde; jo moatte dan kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %2$s. Om de identiteit te bewarjen, klikje jo op Annulearje, skeakelje jo "Alle Babilim-gegevens wiskje by deïnstallearjen" út yn de Babilim-ynstellingen fan dy side en deaktivearje jo opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?' . "\0" . '%1$d siden op dit netwurk binne ynsteld om harren Babilim-identiteit te wiskjen as de plugin fuorthelle wurdt. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dy siden keppele is, kin dan net automatysk werom set wurde; jo moatte dan kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %2$s. Om de identiteiten te bewarjen, klikje jo op Annulearje, skeakelje jo "Alle Babilim-gegevens wiskje by deïnstallearjen" út yn de Babilim-ynstellingen fan elke side en deaktivearje jo opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s.','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s (%2$s): %3$s','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s neat te dwaan.','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s: %2$s. Kies de taal.','%d failed'=>'%d mislearre' . "\0" . '%d mislearre','%d not yet tried'=>'%d noch net probearre' . "\0" . '%d noch net probearre','%d report is waiting. "Always share" and "Don\'t share" apply to all of them.'=>'%d rapport wachtet. "Altyd diele" en "Net diele" jilde foar alle rapporten.' . "\0" . '%d rapporten wachtsje. "Altyd diele" en "Net diele" jilde foar alle rapporten.','%d skipped'=>'%d oerslein' . "\0" . '%d oerslein','%d succeeded'=>'%d slagge' . "\0" . '%d slagge','%d to install'=>'%d te ynstallearjen' . "\0" . '%d te ynstallearjen','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(in iepenbiere kaai foar dizze side oanmakke)','(detected)'=>'(detektearre)','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(allinnich algemiene koades en koördinaten)','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'In opruming waard op %1$s ûnderbrutsen: %2$s. Der is neat wiske.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'In bestân yn it ûnderdiel koe net lêzen wurde, dêrom is it net ynpakt.','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'In host dy\'t mar ien PHP-fersyk tagelyk ferwurket, kin dizze stap net foltôgje.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'In diel fan de upload mislearre hieltyd, dus de upload is annulearre.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Der kin op dit stuit gjin oersetting foar dy taalynstelling op dizze website oanfrege wurde.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent