t ûntbrekkende oersettings yn foar de plugins en tema\'s dy\'t al op jo side ynstallearre binne.','Free'=>'Fergees','Free-plan slots'=>'Plakken fan it fergese plan','General'=>'Algemien','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'As dit ynskeakele is, wurdt by deïnstallearjen ek de identiteit fan dizze side wiske. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dizze side keppele is, kin dêrnei net automatysk werom set wurde; jo moatte dan kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %s om dizze werom te krijen.','Included'=>'Opnommen','Included in index'=>'Opnommen yn de yndeks','Install available translations automatically'=>'Beskikbere fertalingen automatysk ynstallearje','Installed'=>'Ynstallearre','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Ynstallearre fertalingen bliuwe bewarre, mar der wurde gjin kontrôles of downloads mear útfierd.','Installed · %s'=>'Ynstallearre · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %1$s, dizze side hat %2$s','Installed · built for %s'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, nije ferzje mislearre','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, nije ferzje is pland','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, de nije ferzje wurdt oerset…','Installed · built for %s; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s; dizze plugin of dit tema wurdt net mear dekt troch it tsjinstplan fan de side','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, nije ferzje mislearre','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, nije ferzje is pland','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, de nije ferzje wurdt oerset…','Installed · built for a different version; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje; dizze plugin of dit tema wurdt net mear dekt troch it tsjinstplan fan de side','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'It wurdt bewarre troch de hostingprovider fan de tsjinst en ferwurke troch AI-modellen om de oersetting te meitsjen.','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Bewarje myn eigen fertalingsoerskriuwingen by it folslein wiskjen of it deïnstallearjen fan dizze plugin.','Language'=>'Taal','Language:'=>'Taal:','Languages'=>'Talen','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Talen fûn op dizze website: %s.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Lêste opruming op %1$s: %2$d nij markearre, %3$d bestân(en) wiske, %4$d record(s) fuortsmiten.','Maintenance'=>'Ûnderhâld','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'De ûnderhâldsstatus is op it stuit net beskikber.','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest net beskikber: %s','Negation reversed'=>'Negaasje omkeard','No'=>'Nee','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Der is gjin build beskikber om te downloaden foar dizze taalynstelling.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Der is noch gjin opruming útfierd.','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Gjin komponinten komme oerien mei dizze filters. %s','No components synced yet.'=>'Noch gjin komponinten synchronisearre.','No installed translation matches.'=>'Gjin ynstallearre oersetting stimt oerein.','No language is managed yet.'=>'Der wurdt noch gjin taal beheard.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Gjin útdaging yn ôfwachting foar dizze nonce.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Gjin útdaging yn ôfwachting om te ferifiearjen.','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Gjin plugins of tema\'s fûn.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Gjin foarige build om nei werom te draaien.','No record for %s'=>'Gjin record foar %s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Der is gjin side-id opslein yn in bestân om in token foar te roterjen.','No — component inactive'=>'Nee — ûnderdiel ynaktyf','No — component removed'=>'Nee — ûnderdiel fuortsmiten','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Nee — de ynstallearre ferzje wykt ôf fan de aktive ferzje','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Gjin jildige server_build_id: %s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'Net dekt troch it fergese tsjinstplan','Not installed'=>'Net ynstallearre','Not registered yet'=>'Noch net registrearre','Not supported'=>'Net stipe','Not verified'=>'Net ferifiearre','Note (optional)'=>'Opmerking (opsjoneel)','Nothing to choose.'=>'Neat om te kiezen.','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Neat om te befêstigjen.','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Standert utskeakele: by it wiskjen fan de plugin bliuwt de identiteit fan dizze side bewarre, sadat in nije ynstallaasje dy opnij brûke kin.','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Ien of mear levere bestannen komme net mear oerien mei it manifest.','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Ienmalige oankeap foar dizze side: %1$s %2$s. Omfettet alle takomstige oersettingsupdates. De betelling wurdt ferwurke troch Paddle yn in nij ljepblêd.','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Dit kin allinnich dien wurde troch in netwurkbehearder, om\'t dit fertalingsbestannen wizigret dy\'t dield wurde troch alle websites yn dit netwurk.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Allinnich plugins en tema\'s kinne ynpakt wurde.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Allinnich as jo in upload befêstigje foar in plugin of tema dat net op WordPress.org stiet: elk .php- en .js-Bestân, elk block.json-Bestân, en de readme.txt, readme.md, style.css en theme.json yn de haadmap fan dy komponint, as zip, neidat Bestannen dy\'t oerienkomme mei gewoane geheime gegevens (lykas wachtwurden en kaaien) weilitten binne.','Open Babilim settings'=>'Babilim-ynstellingen iepenje','Original language'=>'Orizjinele taal','Original string'=>'Orizjineel tekst','Paid'=>'Betelle','Partner'=>'Partner','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Kontrolearje dat jo website fan it ynternet út berikber is en probearje it dan opnij.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Kies in kategory foar dit rapport.','Plugin'=>'Plugin','Plugin · %s'=>'Plugin · %s','Plugins'=>'Plugins','Preview'=>'Foarbyld','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Oankeap werombrocht. Dizze side is no lisinsjearre.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'It oantal opnij ynlêzen items kaam net oerien mei de opboude yndeks.','Re-verify'=>'Opnij kontrolearje','Rebuild index now'=>'Yndeks no opnij opbouwe','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Skriuwen bûten de Babilim-taalbestânmap wurdt wegere.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'It Registraasjeantwurd miste fereaske fjilden.','Registration restarted.'=>'Registraasje is opnij start.','Remove'=>'Ferwiderje','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Alles ferwiderje dat Babilim ynstallearre hat','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Alles ferwiderje dat Babilim ynstallearre hat? Dit wisket elk taalbestân (File) dat it foar elke plugin en elk tema op dizze side ynstallearre hat.','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'De %2$s-oersetting fan %1$s fan dizze side fuortsmite?','Removed %d installed component.'=>'%d ynstallearre ûnderdiel fuorthelle.' . "\0" . '%d ynstallearre ûnderdielen fuorthelle.','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Fuortsmiten nei in mislearre yntegriteitskontrôle','Removed.'=>'Fuortsmiten.','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Smyt elk taalbestân fuort dy\'t Babilim foar alle plugins en tema\'s op dizze side ynstallearre hat.','Report a problem'=>'In probleem melde','Report translation'=>'Oersetting melde','Request newer translation'=>'Nijere oersetting oanfreegje','Request translation'=>'Fertaling oanfreegje','Requestable'=>'Oanfreegber','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Wannear\'t jo in oersetting oanfreegje, wurdt dizze plugin of dit tema op ien fan de slots fan it fergees tsjinstplan foar dizze side set (de limyt is %1$d foar tema\'s en %2$d foar plugins), útsein as it der al ien hat. In slot bliuwt yn gebrûk, en in mislearre oersetting makket it net frij.','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Wannear\'t jo in oersetting oanfreegje, wurdt dizze plugin of dit tema op ien fan de slots fan it fergees tsjinstplan foar dizze side set, útsein as it der al ien hat. In slot bliuwt yn gebrûk, en in mislearre oersetting makket it net frij.','Requesting…'=>'Oanfreegje…','Restart registration'=>'Registraasje opnij starte','Restore code'=>'Werhelkoade','Restore purchase'=>'Oankeap werhelje','Retry request'=>'Fersyk opnij besykje','Roll back'=>'Weromdraaie','Roll back and report'=>'Weromdraaie en melde','Roll back and send report'=>'Weromdraaie en rapport ferstjoere','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'De %2$s-fertaling fan %1$s weromsette nei de foarige build?','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Weromset en rapportearre.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Weromset nei de foarige build.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Weromset, mar it rapport koe net ferstjoerd wurde: %s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Weromdraaie soe \'%1$s\' (%2$s) oerskriuwe, dat no levere wurdt foar in oar ynstallearre ûnderdiel (%3$s); der is neat wizige.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'It antwurd op token-rotaasje miste site_token.','Save changes'=>'Wizigingen bewarje','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Pland, wachtet op ferwurking','Search'=>'Sykje','Search components'=>'Komponinten sykje','Search the installed translations'=>'Sykje yn de ynstallearre oersettingen','Select all'=>'Alles selektearje','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Selektearje minder komponinten: maksimaal %1$d bewurkingen per run (jo selektearren %2$d).','Send report'=>'Rapport ferstjoere','Service plan'=>'Tsjinstplan','Settings'=>'Ynstellingen','Share error reports'=>'Flaterrapporten diele','Share this report'=>'Dit rapport diele','Show a new restore code'=>'In nije werhelkoade toane','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'It item "Oersetting melde" sjen litte yn de arkbalke fan it behear','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Guon tekst fan dit ûnderdiel is troch de skriuwer hurdkodearre en kin net troch in taalpakket oerset wurde.','Status'=>'Status','Status unknown'=>'Status ûnbekend','String context'=>'Stringkontekst','Suggested translation'=>'Foarsteld fertaling','Supplementary translation index'=>'Oanfoljende fertalingsyndeks','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Oanfoljend fertalingsyndeks opnij opboud.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Ûnderhâld fan oanfoljende oersettingen','Supplementary translations'=>'Oanfoljende fertalingen','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Opromjouwing ôfbrutsen sûnder wat dan ek wees te meitsjen: %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Opromjen foltôge: %d bestân wiske.' . "\0" . 'Opromjen foltôge: %d bestannen wiske.','Sweep now'=>'No opromje','Sync complete.'=>'Syngronisaasje foltôge.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Tank. Jo rapport is ferstjoerd.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Dat ûnderdiel is net ynstallearre op dizze side, dus der kin gjin fertaling foar oanfrege wurde.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Dat liket net op in werhelkoade.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Dat is gjin jildige WordPress-lokaalkoade. Der is neat bewarre.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Dat is gjin jildige build-identifikator.','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'Dat oploadskerm wie ferâldere: der is yntusken in oare upload taret. Der is neat ferstjoerd. Besjoch de aktuele fia de Translations-list.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'De wiziging koe net yn de fertalingsyndeks opslein wurde; probearje it opnij.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'De opromming is útfierd, mar guon fan de wizigingen koene net yn de fertalingsyndeks fêstlein wurde; de folgjende opromming sil se opnij besykje.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'De komponint hat gjin bestannen dy\'t uploade wurde kinne.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'It ûnderdiel stiet net yn de map foar plugins of tema\'s.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'It haadbestân fan it ûnderdiel is net fûn.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Yn it downloadantwurd ûntbriek in brûkbere lokaasje.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'It item iepenet in paniel om de oersettingen te sykjen dy\'t Babilim op dizze website ynstallearre hat en om ien dêrfan te melden.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'It fjild "%1$s" is te lang: it hat %2$d tekens en de limyt is %3$d. Der is neat ferstjoerd; koartsje it yn en besykje it opnij.','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'It fergees tsjinstplan jout elke side in beheind oantal slots foar plugins en tema\'s; de slots yn gebrûk wurde toand yn Settings nei\'t jo Babilim ynskeakele hawwe.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'It opjûne domein \'%1$s\' komt noch oerien mei de eigen slug \'%2$s\' fan it pakketmanifest, noch mei syn text_domain \'%3$s\'.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'De gearfoege yndeks foar \'%s\' is op \'e nij opboud, mar de fertalingsyndeks koe it net fêstlizze; de folgjende op \'e nij opbou sil it opnij besykje.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'De orizjinele tekst en de oersettingen dy\'t dêrfan makke binne, wurde beskikber steld oan oare websteden dy\'t deselde ferzje ynstallearje.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'It pakket jout gjin haadoersettingsbestân op.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'It pakket hat gjin %s foar syn eigen tekstdomein.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'It soarte \'%1$s\' fan it pakketmanifest komt net oerien mei it frege soarte \'%2$s\'.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'It pakket hat gjin leverbere haadfertalingsbestân opsmiten.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'It tekstdomein \'%1$s\' fan it pakket komt net oerien mei de kopy fan dizze side fan it ûnderdiel (\'%2$s\'), dêrom is it net ynstallearre.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'It ynpakte ûnderdiel koe net lêzen wurde.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'De registraasje-útdaging hat net de ferwachte foarm.','The report could not be sent.'=>'It rapport koe net ferstjoerd wurde.','The search could not be completed.'=>'It sykjen koe net foltôge wurde.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'De tsjinst frege dizze side om te wachtsjen foar\'t er wer syngronisearret.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'De tsjinst koe jo website net berikke. In firewall, befeiligingsplugin of host-regel blokkearret it fersyk wierskynlik; stean fersiken ta oan /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'It oanbod fan de tsjinst foar it uploaden wie ûnfolslein.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'It tekstdomein \'%1$s\' (%2$s) wurdt al levere foar in oar ynstallearre ûnderdiel (%3$s); der is neat ynstallearre.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'De upload wurdt bewarre oant jo Babilim freegje him te wiskjen.','Theme'=>'Tema','Theme · %s'=>'Tema · %s','Themes'=>'Tema\'s','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Der is gjin upload oan \'e gong.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Der is gjin upload dy\'t op befêstiging wachtet.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Dit binne de talen dy\'t dizze side brûkt. Jo kinne se wizigje yn %s.','These fields will be sent:'=>'Dizze fjilden wurde ferstjoerd:','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Dizze build is gjin build dy\'t dizze side op dit stuit kent foar dit ûnderdiel/dizze lokaalkoade.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Dit ûnderdiel jout gjin ferzjenûmer op, dus der kin gjin fertaling foar oanfrege wurde.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Dit ûnderdiel is grutter as de tsjinst accepteart, dus it kin net uploade wurde.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Dit ûnderdiel is al oplade. Babilim kontrolearret it no.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'It ferzjenûmer fan dit ûnderdiel is langer as %d tekens, wat Babilim net ferwurkje kin, dus der kin gjin fertaling foar oanfrege wurde.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Dit jout in nije werhelkoade út en de foarige hâldt op mei wurkjen. Trochgean?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Dit netwurk hat te folle siden om se ien foar ien te kontrolearjen, en guon dêrfan binne mooglik ynsteld om harren Babilim-identiteit te wiskjen as de plugin fuorthelle wurdt. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan sa\'n side keppele is, kin dan net automatysk werom set wurde; jo moatte dan kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %s. Om de identiteiten te bewarjen, klikje jo op Annulearje, skeakelje jo "Alle Babilim-gegevens wiskje by deïnstallearjen" út yn de Babilim-ynstellingen fan elke side en deaktivearje jo opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'De eigen ferzje fan dizze plugin, sadat de tsjinst jo sizze kin om by te wurkjen as it te âld is om mei te praten.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Dit rapport neamt gjin jildige plugin of tema en taalynstelling.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Dit rapport neamt gjin ynstallearre string.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Dit rapport mist in jildige build om tsjin te rapportearjen.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Dit rapport wurdt iepenbier pleatst op GitHub en kin troch tredden bewarre wurde.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Dizze werhelkoade is foar dizze side net werkend.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Dizze website hat al in aktive registraasje dy\'t net mear automatysk werstelle wurde kin.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Dizze side hat %1$d ûnderdielen yn %2$d talen, wat %3$d kontrolegroepen nedich hat; Babilim kin maksimaal %4$d per run ferwurkje. Ferminderje de beheard talen yn de ynstellingen of deaktivearje net brûkte plugins en tema\'s, en klik dan op No opnij kontrolearje.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Dizze side hat gjin oankeap om in koade foar te toanen.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Dizze website hat al in lisinsje. Laad de side opnij.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Dizze website is noch net registrearre by Babilim.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Dizze website is grutter as de tsjinst yn ien synchronisaasje akseptearret, dus guon items binne weilitten: %1$d komponinten en %2$d taalregio\'s.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Dizze website is diel fan in multisite-netwurk, dat nije fertalingen net automatysk ynstallearret. Fertalingen dy\'t al ynstallearre binne, wurde noch wol bywurke.','This site is verified.'=>'Dizze website is kontrolearre.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Dizze side moat earst ferifiearre wurde.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'De URL fan dizze side, sadat de tsjinst kontrolearje kin dat jo de eigener binne.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'It adres fan dizze side is te lang foar Babilim om te registrearjen.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'De ynstelde taal- en regio-ynstelling fan dizze side.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'De lokaalkoade fan dizze side is gjin koade dy\'t Babilim registrearje kin.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Dizze tekenrige kin net fan dizze website út melde wurde.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Dizze string is net ien fan de oersettingen dy\'t op dizze website ynstallearre binne. Sykje opnij en kies him út de list.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Dizze oersetting is bywurke sûnt jo socht hawwe. Sykje opnij en kies de string út de nije list.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Om dit ûnderdiel te fertalen, hat Babilim de boarne derfan nedich.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Te folle besykjen. Besykje it moarn opnij.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Te folle rapporten hjoed. Probearje it moarn opnij.','Too many requests.'=>'Te folle fersiken.','Toolbar'=>'Arkbalke','Translating…'=>'Oersette…','Translation does not load'=>'Fertaling wurdt net laden','Translation failed'=>'Oersetting mislearre','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Fertalingsbestannen dy\'t jo yn %s pleatse, hawwe altyd foarrang op dy fan Babilim. Se wurde bewarre, útsein as jo dit fakje útskeakelje.','Translation requested.'=>'Oersetting oanfrege.','Translations'=>'Oersettingen','Type'=>'Type','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Typ teminsten 2 tekens om te sykjen.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Unferwachte HTTP-antwurd %d.','Uninstall'=>'Deïnstallearje','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Unbekend type: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Unfeilich domein: %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Ûnfeilige taal- en regiokoade: %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Ûnfeilige slug: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'Ûnfeilige text_domain: %s','Update'=>'Bywurkje','Update available'=>'Fernijing beskikber','Updates'=>'Bywurkingen','Updating…'=>'Bywurkje…','Upgrade this site'=>'Dizze side opwurdearje','Upload and request'=>'Oplade en oanfreegje','Upload cancelled.'=>'Upload annulearre.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Upload foltôge — oersetting oanfrege.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Upload is ferrûn foardat er klear wie','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Upload dwaande — trochgean of annulearje','Upload this component?'=>'Dit ûnderdiel oplade?','Upload was not accepted'=>'Upload is net akseptearre','Uploading'=>'Oplade','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Diel %1$d fan %2$d oplade…','Uploading…'=>'Oplade…','Verified'=>'Ferifiearre','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'It ferifikaasjeantwurd miste site_token.','Version %s'=>'Ferzje %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Wat der ferstjoerd wurdt as jo Babilim ynskeakelje','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Stjoer by in flater yn Babilim in flaterrapport nei de Babilim-tsjinst, sadat it as iepenbier probleem op GitHub publisearre wurde kin. It rapport wurdt ferstjoerd as komt it fan dizze website, mei deselde autentikaasje as elk oar fersyk oan de Babilim-tsjinst. De tsjinst publisearret allinnich de flaterkoade en ferzjes as iepenbier probleem op GitHub; it iepenbiere probleem befettet gjin websteteadres, ynhâld of bestânspaden. Standert útskeakele.','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Wêr jo dit seagen (opsjoneel)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'As dit ynskeakele is, wurde oersettingen dy\'t de tsjinst as beskikber oanjout foar de talen dy\'t jo beheare, ynstallearre by de syngronisaasje dy\'t twa kear deis plakfynt.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Ferkeard foar dizze kontekst','Wrong meaning'=>'Ferkearde betsjutting','Wrong plural form'=>'Ferkearde meartalsfoarm','Wrong term'=>'Ferkearde term','Yes'=>'Ja','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Jo hawwe gjin tastimming om dit te dwaan.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Jo PHP-ferzje, foar kompatibiliteit.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Jo WordPress-ferzje, om kompatibele oersettingsbestannen te leverjen.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Jo nije werhelkoade: %s. Bewarje dizze op in feilige plak — de foarige koade wurket net mear.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Jo rapport wurdt automatysk ferwurke troch AI-modellen en kin dizze oersetting foar oare websites ferbetterje.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Jo website antwurde, mar net mei wat ferwachte waard. De REST API wurdt mooglik herskreaun troch in oare plugin, of dat einpunt is yn de cache opslein; slút /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge út fan caching en herskriuwen.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Jo website die te lang oer it antwurdzjen. Probearje it letter opnij en kontrolearje dat jo host net te stadich of oerbelêste is.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip hat gjin manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Yn de zip ûntbrekt it ferwachte standertbestân: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Yn de zip ûntbrekt it ferwachte bestân: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json hat in ûnferwachte struktuer','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'koe _manifest.json net lêze: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest ûntbrekt of hat in ûnjildige \'%s\'.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'De \'server_build_id\' fan expected_manifest is gjin jildich build-id.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'Kin _manifest.json net parsearje: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'it soe %1$d fan %2$d beheard ûnderdielen wees meitsje (mear as de helte)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'it soe elk beheard %1$s-ûnderdiel wees meitsje (%2$d fan %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Oantal items yn l10n.php komt net oerien foar %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json hat in ûnjildige \'default_domain_entries\'.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json hat in ûnjildige \'default_domain_files\'.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json yn de zip is gjin jildige JSON.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json ûntbrekt of hat in ûnjildich fjild \'%s\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json ûntbrekt of hat in ûnjildich fjild \'build_no\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json ûntbrekt of hat in ûnjildich fjild \'entries\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json ûntbrekt of hat in ûnjildich fjild \'extra_domains\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json ûntbrekt of hat in ûnjildich fjild \'files\'.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'\'%s\' yn manifest.json komt net oerien mei de ferwachte wearde.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'\'contract\' yn manifest.json is gjin jildige ferzjetekst.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'It fjild \'kind\' yn manifest.json moat de wearde \'plugin\' of \'theme\' hawwe.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' yn manifest.json is gjin jildige build-id.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'De \'status\' yn manifest.json moat de wearde \'published\' hawwe.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce moat in heksadesimale tekenrige wêze.','per day'=>'per dei','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'sha256-ferskil foar %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'De sha256-kontrôlesom komt net oerien foar default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'plugin','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'tema','problem report categoryOther'=>'Oars','translation statusAvailable'=>'Beskikber','translation statusInstalled'=>'Ynstallearre','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Babilim-oersetting útskeakele.','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'Babilim-oersetting net mear brûke','Use Babilim translation'=>'Babilim-oersetting brûke','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Wolle jo de Babilim-oersetting fan %1$s (%2$s) net mear brûke? WordPress brûkt dan de eigen oersetting fan it tema of de WordPress.org-oersetting. Jo kinne op elk momint weromskeakelje.','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Wolle jo de Babilim-oersetting fan %1$s (%2$s) net mear brûke? WordPress brûkt dan de eigen oersetting fan de plugin of de WordPress.org-oersetting. Jo kinne op elk momint weromskeakelje.','Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes'=>'Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes','Enjoying Babilim? Please leave a rating on WordPress.org.'=>'Genietsto fan Babilim? Lit asjebleaft in wurdearring achter op WordPress.org.','Rate Babilim'=>'Wurdearje Babilim','Babilim translation bundled with the theme'=>'Babilim-oersetting meilevere mei it tema','Babilim translation bundled with the plugin'=>'Babilim-oersetting meilevere mei de plugin','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, the languages it already includes, and which of those bundled translations Babilim generated (language codes only). For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'Foar elke ynstallearre plugin en elk tema: de namme (slug), de ferzje, it text domain, oft it op WordPress.org stiet, de talen dy\'t it al befettet, en hokker fan dy meilevere oersettingen troch Babilim generearre binne (allinnich taalkoades). Foar elke Babilim-oersetting dy\'t jo ynstallearre hawwe: hokker ferzje it is, wannear it foar it lêst kontrolearre is, en oft it syn Bestânskontrôle trochstien is.']];